<title>USA: Amerada Hess Q3 profit vs loss. [CORRECTED 19:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Amerada Hess Q3 profit vs loss. [CORRECTED 19:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.05     loss	 $1.13</p>
<p> Net profit		97,800     loss     104,600</p>
<p> Revs		   1,869,900		1,633,300</p>
<p>		     Nine Months</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $5.80     loss	 $1.29</p>
<p> Net profit	     540,300     loss     119,600</p>
<p> Revs		   6,646,200		5,419,600</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: First Call consensus Q3 estimate was $0.22.</p>
<p>1996 net includes gains of $71.1 million, or $0.76/shr, in quarter and $421.1 million, or $4.52/shr, in nine months.</p>
<p>1995 (Corrects year from 1996) net includes net charges of $26.0 million in quarter and net gains of $17.9 million in nine months.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
